{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁同意了我的提议，一天过去，到了周二的早晨。", "text_idx": 157, "plain": "安洁同意了我的提议，一天过去，到了周二的早晨。", "plain_idx": 157, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们早早到了学校，直接来到了校长室。", "text_idx": 158, "plain": "我们早早到了学校，直接来到了校长室。", "plain_idx": 158, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你们来得真早啊」", "text_idx": 159, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0453", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯，幸亏我们来得早才能见到兰华校长，我真是松了口气啊……呼」", "text_idx": 161, "plain": "「嗯嗯，幸亏我们来得早才能见到兰华校长，我真是松了口气啊……呼」", "plain_idx": 161, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2547", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们昨天下午来了好几次，都没能遇到兰华校长」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": "「我们昨天下午来了好几次，都没能遇到兰华校长」", "plain_idx": 163, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2548", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊抱歉抱歉，我最近太忙了。说实话都很久没到这里来了啊」", "text_idx": 165, "plain": "「啊啊抱歉抱歉，我最近太忙了。说实话都很久没到这里来了啊」", "plain_idx": 165, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0454", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我还拜托了爱理同学用手机帮我传话呢～」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": "「我还拜托了爱理同学用手机帮我传话呢～」", "plain_idx": 167, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2549", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊——我还以为是爱理找我有事，就想着之后再说呢。啊哈哈」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": "「啊——我还以为是爱理找我有事，就想着之后再说呢。啊哈哈」", "plain_idx": 169, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0455", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不管怎么说，能像现在这样，平安无事地见到你就好……」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": "「不管怎么说，能像现在这样，平安无事地见到你就好……」", "plain_idx": 171, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然她以前也总说“没有时间”，但现在临近年末，她似乎变得更忙了。", "text_idx": 172, "plain": "虽然她以前也总说“没有时间”，但现在临近年末，她似乎变得更忙了。", "plain_idx": 172, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天果断放弃，决定今天早上再尝试一下，是正确的选择。", "text_idx": 173, "plain": "昨天果断放弃，决定今天早上再尝试一下，是正确的选择。", "plain_idx": 173, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「结果还是麻烦少爷连日早起了」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": "「结果还是麻烦少爷连日早起了」", "plain_idx": 174, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2550", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是你看，我也获得了百分百的那个啊」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔，其实安洁到现在都还心跳不已呢」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2551", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
