{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「保、保密！说得好听点的话，是只有我们两人知晓的秘密！」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": "「保、保密！说得好听点的话，是只有我们两人知晓的秘密！」", "plain_idx": 181, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2552", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「听起来很色情呢♪　只有两人知晓的秘密」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0457", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「请请请请不要再解读了」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2553", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她虽然没说，但是基本上等于是说了……", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好了，不能在这里扭扭捏捏的，该讲正事了。", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的提案，无论如何都要得到校长的认可才行。", "text_idx": 189, "plain": "我的提案，无论如何都要得到校长的认可才行。", "plain_idx": 189, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说，校长，能占用你一点时间吗？」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": "「话说，校长，能占用你一点时间吗？」", "plain_idx": 190, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
