{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，是安洁多说了一些没用的话吗？！」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": "「啊啊，是安洁多说了一些没用的话吗？！」", "plain_idx": 197, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2554", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从各种意义上来说，确实。", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总之，我了解了。安洁，这样的话……」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": "「总之，我了解了。安洁，这样的话……」", "plain_idx": 200, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的，那我就切换一下状态，直接进入主题」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": "「好的，那我就切换一下状态，直接进入主题」", "plain_idx": 201, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2555", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁挺直了背，直视着校长说出了来意。", "text_idx": 203, "plain": "安洁挺直了背，直视着校长说出了来意。", "plain_idx": 203, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等到期末典礼的时候，可以让我做一个巨大的圣诞蛋糕吗？」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": "「等到期末典礼的时候，可以让我做一个巨大的圣诞蛋糕吗？」", "plain_idx": 204, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2556", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "校长稍稍停顿了一下。", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……怎么一回事？」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0460", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「具体来说，就是安洁希望你在期末典礼时给她个机会，让她给全体学生送上蛋糕」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": "「具体来说，就是安洁希望你在期末典礼时给她个机会，让她给全体学生送上蛋糕」", "plain_idx": 209, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
