{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「与其说是道谢，不如说是安洁想要报答大家，就是这样」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": "「与其说是道谢，不如说是安洁想要报答大家，就是这样」", "plain_idx": 216, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2559", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，你才说想要给大家做圣诞蛋糕吗」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0461", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，虽说离圣诞节还有些日子」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是这种事情，总要找一个华丽一点的理由吧」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「同时也是在庆祝第二学期的结束，这样就是三重的喜悦了！」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": "「同时也是在庆祝第二学期的结束，这样就是三重的喜悦了！」", "plain_idx": 222, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2560", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「原来是这样啊」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0462", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
