{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你要找我商量的不是学校的工作，而是私人问题啊」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": "「你要找我商量的不是学校的工作，而是私人问题啊」", "plain_idx": 227, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0463", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2561", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……而且，如果要做蛋糕的话，少爷也会帮忙的哦」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": "「……而且，如果要做蛋糕的话，少爷也会帮忙的哦」", "plain_idx": 231, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2562", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁红着脸继续说着。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，这个，我会争取不拖后腿的」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": "「啊哈哈，这个，我会争取不拖后腿的」", "plain_idx": 234, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「昨天早上只是让您陪着我，真的很抱歉」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": "「昨天早上只是让您陪着我，真的很抱歉」", "plain_idx": 235, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2563", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「蛋糕，还是我们一起来做吧」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2564", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯、我会加油的……我们一起加油吧」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的！」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2565", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不是只有安洁或只有我，而是我们两人一起，向大家表达谢意。", "text_idx": 242, "plain": "不是只有安洁或只有我，而是我们两人一起，向大家表达谢意。", "plain_idx": 242, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然要这样做是安洁先想到的……", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“两个人一起”向大家表达谢意，对于我们来说，说不定是最重要的事。", "text_idx": 244, "plain": "“两个人一起”向大家表达谢意，对于我们来说，说不定是最重要的事。", "plain_idx": 244, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为，是我们两人一起，才变得幸福的。", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我觉得，一次性对大家都这么做也有其意义」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": "「我觉得，一次性对大家都这么做也有其意义」", "plain_idx": 246, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也有想过分别给每一个人准备点什么东西之类的……」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": "「我也有想过分别给每一个人准备点什么东西之类的……」", "plain_idx": 247, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2566", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是我总觉得，跟大家分享同样的东西，感觉会十分不错」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": "「但是我总觉得，跟大家分享同样的东西，感觉会十分不错」", "plain_idx": 249, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2567", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——毕竟我们才体会到了与人分享情感的喜悦啊。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": "——毕竟我们才体会到了与人分享情感的喜悦啊。", "plain_idx": 251, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们一起向校长鞠了一躬。", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是这样，拜托了，校长」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以允许我们这样做吗」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2568", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0464", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "校长微笑着，长长地舒了一口气。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她弯腰拿起了包，在里面翻找着什么……", "text_idx": 259, "plain": "她弯腰拿起了包，在里面翻找着什么……", "plain_idx": 259, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她拿出一捆钞票，甩在了桌上。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……兰华校长？」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2569", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这次轮到我们愣住了。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉啊，我最近有点忙，帮不上你们什么忙」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": "「抱歉啊，我最近有点忙，帮不上你们什么忙」", "plain_idx": 264, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0465", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说起来有点那什么，材料费用就由我来出，把钱拿好」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": "「说起来有点那什么，材料费用就由我来出，把钱拿好」", "plain_idx": 266, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0466", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「校长……」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你们想要向同学们道谢，我也想要向你们道谢啊」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": "「你们想要向同学们道谢，我也想要向你们道谢啊」", "plain_idx": 269, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0467", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "校长露出雪白的牙齿，朝我们笑着。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁，一直以来有你在，真是帮大忙了，我很开心，也很快乐」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": "「安洁，一直以来有你在，真是帮大忙了，我很开心，也很快乐」", "plain_idx": 272, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0468", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「让这样的安洁“变得幸福”，也要谢谢你，小新吾」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": "「让这样的安洁“变得幸福”，也要谢谢你，小新吾」", "plain_idx": 274, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0469", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「兰、兰、兰华校长」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2570", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么……」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我同意了！」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0470", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "校长高声说道。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你们的幸福，也让我校的同学们看看吧」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": "「你们的幸福，也让我校的同学们看看吧」", "plain_idx": 282, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0471", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「非常感谢！！」\\n「非常感谢！！」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": "「非常感谢！！」「非常感谢！！」", "plain_idx": 286, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾／安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": "ag2571", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们再次向她鞠了一躬。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
